    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015100/extras/69472511bd50f27b9aca51b04d2680b9.poster.avif?t=1722268488\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015100/extras/69472511bd50f27b9aca51b04d2680b9.webm?t=1722268488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015100/extras/69472511bd50f27b9aca51b04d2680b9.mp4?t=1722268488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Apocalyptic Cat</strong> is an atmospheric and hardcore platformer that tells the story of a little black cat journeying through a toxic and desolate post-apocalyptic world, devoid of all life. The player's goal is to guide the cat upwards towards the heavens, navigating through toxic clouds, dangerous spikes, and stone obstacles to fulfill the cat's final and only dream of reaching a majestic paradise after its time on the scorched earth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015100/extras/47691e85bc1dfab7b9fc129db0092960.poster.avif?t=1722268488\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015100/extras/47691e85bc1dfab7b9fc129db0092960.webm?t=1722268488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015100/extras/47691e85bc1dfab7b9fc129db0092960.mp4?t=1722268488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2></strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Experience:</h2></strong>Immerse yourself in a hauntingly beautiful post-apocalyptic environment with stunning visuals and a captivating soundtrack that enhances the sense of desolation and hope.<br></li><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Gameplay:</h2></strong>Engage in hardcore platforming with precise controls, where every jump and movement must be carefully timed to avoid deadly obstacles and reach higher grounds.<br></li><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intriguing Storyline:</h2></strong>Follow the touching narrative of the little black cat, whose sole desire is to escape the ruined world and find peace in paradise, providing emotional depth to the gameplay.<br></li><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Level Design:</h2></strong>Navigate through creatively designed levels featuring toxic clouds, sharp spikes, and treacherous stone barriers, each presenting unique challenges that test your platforming skills and strategic thinking.</li></ul>",
